== Trivia ==
*'''Aura'''{{'}}s skin is that of a plague doctor.<ref>https://www.minecraftskins.net/plaguedoctor</ref>
*'''Aura'''{{'}}s lab contains a [[Fairy Soul]] in a structure that implies it— or the Fairy that spawned it— were experimented on.
*'''Aura''' was [[Candidate Aura|a mayor candidate]] in the Year 458 elections, and resigned in Year 468.
*The official wiki page was changed to say "good plan" instead of "evil plan" after '''Aura''' became a mayor candidate.<ref>https://wiki.hypixel.net/index.php?title=Aura&diff=prev&oldid=308571</ref>

